{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-zec-13-1","title":"Zechariah 13:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The fountain of purgation for Jerusalem, 2 from idolatry, and false prophecy. 7 The death of Christ, and the trial of a third part.</p>\n<p>that, 12:3,8,11 a fountain, Job 9:30,31; Ps 51:2,7; Isa 1:16-18; Eze 36:25; Joh 1:29; 19:34,35 1Co 6:11; Eph 5:25-27; Tit 3:5-7; Heb 9:13,14; 1Jo 1:7; 5:6 1Pe 1:19; Re 1:5,6; 7:13,14 the house. 12:7,10 uncleanness. Heb. separation for uncleanness. Le 15:2-33; Nu 19:9-22; Eze 36:17,29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-13-2","title":"Zechariah 13:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>I will cut. Ex 22:13; De 12:3; Jos 23:7; Ps 16:4; Isa 2:18,20; Eze 30:13; 36:25 Eze 37:23; Ho 2:17; 14:8; Mic 5:12-14; Zep 1:3,4; 2:11 cause. 1Ki 22:22; Jer 8:10-12; 23:14,15; 29:23; Eze 13:12-16,23; 14:9 Mic 2:11; Mt 7:15; 2Co 11:13-15; 2Pe 2:1-3,15-19; 1Jo 4:1,2 Re 19:20 unclean. Mt 12:43; Lu 11:20; Re 16:13,14; 18:2; 20:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-13-3","title":"Zechariah 13:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>and his. Ex 32:27,28; De 13:6-11; 18:20; 33:9; Mt 10:37; Lu 14:26; 2Co 5:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-13-4","title":"Zechariah 13:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the prophets. Jer 2:26; Mic 3:6,7 wear. 2Ki 1:8; Isa 20:2; Mt 3:4; 11:8,9; Mr 1:6; Re 11:3 rough garment to deceive. Heb. garment of hair to lie.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-13-5","title":"Zechariah 13:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>I am no. Am 7:14; Ac 19:17-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-13-6","title":"Zechariah 13:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>What. 1Ki 18:28; Re 13:16,17; 14:11 I was. Ps 22:16; Pr 27:5,6; Joh 18:35; 19:14-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-13-7","title":"Zechariah 13:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>O sword. De 32:41,42; Isa 27:1; Jer 47:6; Eze 21:4,5,9,10,28 my shepherd. 11:4,7; Isa 40:11; Eze 34:23,24; 37:24; Mic 5:2,4; Joh 10:10-18 Heb 13:20; 1Pe 5:4 the man. Isa 9:6; Jer 23:5,6; Ho 12:3-5; Mt 1:23; 11:27; Joh 1:1,2; 5:17,18 Joh 5:23; 8:58; 10:30,38; 14:1,9-11,23; 16:15; 17:21-23; Php 2:6 Col 1:15-19; Heb 1:6-12; Re 1:8,11,17; 2:23; 21:6; 22:13-16 smite. Isa 53:4-10; Da 9:24-26; Joh 1:29; 3:14-17; Ac 2:23; 4:26-28 Ro 3:24-26; 4:25; 5:6-10; 8:32; 2Co 5:21; Ga 3:13; Col 1:19,20 Heb 10:5-10; 1Pe 1:18-20; 2:24,25; 3:18; 1Jo 2:2; 4:9,10; Re 13:8 the sheep. Mt 26:31,56; Mr 14:27,50; Joh 16:32 I will turn. 11:7,11; Mt 10:42; 18:10,11,14; Lu 12:32; 17:2; Joh 18:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-13-8","title":"Zechariah 13:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>two. 11:6-9; De 28:49-68; Isa 65:12-15; 66:4-6,24; Eze 5:2-4,12; Da 9:27 Mal 3:1,2,5; 4:1-3; Mt 3:10-12; 21:43,44; 22:7; 23:35-37; 24:21 Lu 19:41-44; 20:16-18; 21:20-24; 23:28-30; 1Th 2:15,16; Re 8:7-12 Re 16:19 but. 14:1,2; Isa 6:13; Jer 30:11; Joe 2:31,32; Am 9:8,9; Mt 24:22 Mr 13:20; Ro 9:27-29; 11:1-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-13-9","title":"Zechariah 13:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>bring. Ps 66:10-12; Isa 43:2; 1Co 3:11-13; 1Pe 4:12 refine. Job 23:10; Pr 17:3; Isa 48:10; Mal 3:2,3; Jas 1:12; 1Pe 1:6,7 they shall call. 10:6; 12:10; Ps 34:15-19; 50:15; 91:15; Isa 58:9; 65:23,24 Jer 29:11,12; Ho 2:21-23; Joe 2:32; Ac 2:21; Ro 10:12-14 It is my people. 8:8; Le 26:12,44,45; De 26:17-19; Ps 144:15; Isa 44:1-6; Jer 30:22 Jer 31:33; 32:38; Eze 11:20; 36:28; 37:27; Ho 2:23; Mt 22:29-32 Heb 8:10; Re 21:3,4,7</p>"}]}